fact WorkItem(id: "WI-358", description: some(value: "Grammar: allow single-param NAMED arrow types — `(x: T) -> Bool`. Today tree-sitter-anthill rejects a named param in the single-param arrow form: grammar.js `arrow_params` is choice(seq('(',')'), seq('(', $._type, ')'), seq('(', $._tuple_type_arg, ',', commaSep1($._tuple_type_arg), ')')). The single-param alt is a bare $._type, so `(x: Int) -> Bool` is a syntax error ('syntax error near x: Int'); only the multi-param alt (2+) accepts field_decl names via $._tuple_type_arg = choice($._type, $.field_decl). But spec §5.4 allows named arrow params at any arity, and the 046 Modify feed/flow design's find/foreach callbacks are single-param named (p: (x: T) -> Bool, f: (x: T) -> Unit). Discovered during WI-351. PIECES: (a) grammar.js — change the single-param alt to seq('(', $._tuple_type_arg, ')') so it accepts a field_decl too (covers both bare `(T)` and named `(x: T)`); watch for LR/GLR conflicts on tree-sitter generate (after the first _tuple_type_arg, ')' => single, ',' => multi — should be LR(1)-clean, but verify); (b) npx tree-sitter generate + a grammar corpus test for `(x: T) -> B`; (c) NO convert.rs change expected — convert_arrow_type (parse/convert.rs:1669-1685) already walks arrow_params' named_children and captures field_decl names generically, so a single field_decl child Just Works (params[0].0 = Some(x)). VERIFY that holds. ACCEPTANCE: `operation foo(p: (x: Int) -> Bool) -> Bool` parses; the arrow param name is preserved (params[0].0 == Some('x'), mirror parse_arrow_type_named_params at parse_test.rs:2817 but single-param); WI-351 then auto-registers place foo.p.x (CallbackParam) — re-enable the named single-param branch of the wi351_place_tests::single_param_callback_place test (currently uses unnamed (Int) due to this gap); cargo-test green. REF: WI-351 (loader already handles it off the IR once it parses), WI-352 (find/foreach forms need it; foldLeft's 2-param callback already works), docs/design/modify-effect-derive.md, kernel-language.md §5.4, tree-sitter-anthill/grammar.js arrow_params, memory wi351-modify-feed-flow-design."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-05-31T12:12:55Z"))
